 "remarks": "Experience the best of coastal living with the energy and convenience of city life in this stylish loft-style condo in the heart of vibrant SoNo. Soaring two-story south-facing windows fill the open living space with natural light and open to a private balcony. Features include hardwood floors, a well-appointed kitchen, central air, an in-unit washer and dryer, and generous closet space. Enjoy being just steps from the waterfront, Metro-North, restaurants, shopping, and entertainment. Whether you're looking for a primary residence, a weekend getaway, or an investment opportunity, this exceptional property is a must-see. Parking: The current owner leases a parking space in the Haviland Parking Lot, conveniently located directly behind the building.",
